<title>USA: St. Paul, Minn., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>St. Paul, Minn., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan said it won $7 million of St. Paul, Minn., water revenue refunding bonds, Series 1997 C, with a true interest cost of 4.8805 percent.</p>
